<title>BRAZIL: Eletropaulo 9-month net 77.9 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Eletropaulo 9-month net 77.9 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Eletropaulo power firm, owned by Sao Paulo state, released the following earnings figure for 1996's first nine months.</p>
<p>			Jan-Sept 1996	Jan-Sept 1995</p>
<p>    Net		   77.928 million	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE: Figure is in Brazilian reais.</p>
<p>An Eletropaulo official confirmed the number was released to Brazil's stock exchanges, but declined to provide further details on the company's January-September results.</p>
<p>-- James Craig, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 248 5413</p>
